{"parse": {"title": "辉光丝", "pageid": 93521, "text": "<div class=\"mw-parser-output\"><div class=\"item-infobox\"><div style=\"position:absolute; width:100%; height:100%; overflow:hidden;\"><div class=\"glow-top\"><div></div></div><div class=\"glow-bottom\"><div></div></div></div><div class=\"item-infobox-box\"><div class=\"item-infobox-image\"><img alt=\"辉光丝\" src=\"https://huiji-public.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/f/f8/CurrencyItem-207.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"辉光丝\" width=\"256\" height=\"256\" class=\"img-fit mid-position\" data-file-width=\"256\" data-file-height=\"256\" /></div><div class=\"item-infobox-content\"><div class=\"serif\" style=\"font-size:22px\"><b>辉光丝</b><img alt=\"CurrencyIcon-207 1.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/4c/CurrencyIcon-207_1.png/24px-CurrencyIcon-207_1.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/4c/CurrencyIcon-207_1.png/36px-CurrencyIcon-207_1.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/4c/CurrencyIcon-207_1.png/48px-CurrencyIcon-207_1.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"54\" data-file-height=\"54\" /><div class=\"hide-m test-hide grey-small\" style=\"float:right; font-family:sans-serif; font-size:16px\"><span class=\"no-select\">编号ID：</span>2#7</div></div><hr /><div>灯丝的明暗彰示着时代的闭幕与开幕，是神秘学界昂贵无比的货币之一。可用于银行内[惊奇百货]处进行兑换。</div><div style=\"color:#696969\">几度跨越潮湿，暴雨最准时的观众，前来宣告一个时代的落幕。它的闪光总与别离相伴，它的熄灭总与序幕一同到来。</div></div></div></div></div>", "categories": [{"sortkey": "", "category": "物品"}], "displaytitle": "辉光丝"}}